Nothing else. No interactive or headless agent sessions during PRECHECK..SESSION_RUN (already ruled), and none at all once the Air is set up. Disable the Codex auto-updater and app-server daemon there (item 78).

**MACBOOK AIR (24 GB RAM, macOS, Codex CLI):**
